    {
        "text": "0:00 A.M. \\ Dusty"
    },
    {
        "text": "Downtown Lungmen, Busy Street"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you're doing the whole 'triad face' thing again, you know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Welcome back. Did you look into those people for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I came up with a rough sketch. As much as I'd like to bring these evildoers to justice, it looks like it's not going to be a one woman job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "I may have to ask for help at the office.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems they're not your run of the mill punks. And that Aak wasn't exactly forthcoming. He has to go and make everything so complicated...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, who?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...His name is Aak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... Okay, well, since it's not so simple,",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll help out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...You were listening, weren't you? A bunch of street thugs is one thing, but if we're dealing with a large-scale organized syndicate, we can't just go in there and start throwing punches.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We have other options besides going in there and starting to throw punches, don't we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you really going to nail me on semantics?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not joking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Is Uncle Tung okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He wasn't hurt badly. But that's not the point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. It's not. If this were just some underworld spat, I wouldn't get involved.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "But when I see the wicked strike the innocent before my very eyes, I can't sit idly by and let them run amok.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#3",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Thanks. You've earned some finballs. On me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#3",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't need finballs...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way,",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "This business tonight has something to do with Penguin Logistics. They're not even trying to cover up their involvement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They're good people. They probably just got mixed up in it somehow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They've gotten 'mixed up in things somehow' dozens of times this year alone. They need to be a little more careful, and stop making trouble for everyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we run into them, we'll have to give them a warning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
