    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sand Originium Arts. Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guess the freak running Lungmen's underworld had to have some teeth to him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Capone, you don't mean...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He ain't the kinda guy you wanna piss off, capiche?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Rat King? But we're facing off against the boss, Penguin Logistics, and...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And half of Lungmen. Yeah, the outlook ain't so rosy. No room for mistakes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What're you doing, Mr. Capone? Put down the crossbow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You thought going against the Family would be easy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember the face of every last man who agreed to follow me to Lungmen, who's ready to betray Gambino for the sake of survival.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you ain't one of 'em. Take a dirt nap, Gambino dog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.7,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.02,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.25,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 20,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Get outta here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Here I thought you were just an ungrateful cazzo. Now I see you learned to buy and sell men.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who do you think taught me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure as hell wasn't me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You earned my loyalty. Then you let me down harder than anything ever has. I won't make that same mistake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You know what betrayal means, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Siracusa's greatest crime. But too bad for you, your honor and glory ain't worth shit in Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Take it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...the Jack of Spades?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you. You deal too slow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
