    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're even slower with that sword, Gambino. You get hurt in your fight with the Penguins? Or are we openin' old wounds?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Seeing you turn coward like this makes me sick. I'm stuck thinkin' about how I should kill a traitor like you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the Joker here now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.7,
