    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's next? What're you gonna do? You take out Penguin Logistics? You take out the Rat King? You take out the LGD? You take out Wei Yenwu?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're dreaming. Why not fall asleep forever?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, I'll send your ashes back to Siracusa. Maybe I'll have the old village grind your corpse up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
