    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Phew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, it's you two?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't like to go around pickin' on weak little ladies, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "You tore through my boys, walked right up to me, and you don't got a speck of dust on those pretty clothes of yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "You the Rat King's people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Were you in the slums?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You broke up a fight between Sicilians and you got the balls to ask questions?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yeah. I'd say it was you two.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
