        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you just going to watch?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't get me wrong. It's always a good idea to borrow a knife to off somebody, but I gotta deal with this cazzo myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the other hand... You look like you're a handful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I think you should surrender. Really.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028"
