        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're about as good as that wolf. Who knew the Rat King had cards like you up his sleeve!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What cards? What are you talking about? Just get down on the floor and turn yourself in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nng!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
