    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You gettin' beat by a girl over there, Gambino.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh I'm still gonna kill you. Wipe that smile off your face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...You've been looking for chances to take a low blow, dirty fighter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How can you hope to win if you strike with the wrong part of your fist?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will pay for the harm you have done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_cenmetery",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You had me wait so long just to bring me here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is this about? Are we looking at grave plots? You want to be my neighbor even in death?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "text": "After so many years in business, how do you keep such a sharp tongue?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't talk to my customers like this. But you're not a customer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm hurt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...This is Ah Faat's grave. You probably don't know him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "text": "This one's Rascally Chan's, and over here is Fake Yama.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then in the back is Old Wu and the Steel Psycho, plus Lucky On. Lucky On's family was rich, so he got the hillside plot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "So many.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "At least they're all neighbors. We should think about where we'll stay too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think it's still too early for that. Or are you trying to tell me you've got some terminal illness?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not early. We don't live long enough, so it always feels like we've been through tough times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like me. Our brothers gave their lives for us. But now that I've settled down, I look back and reflect on my life...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "text": "And nothing seems like that big a deal anymore. If there was anything really that big, I wouldn't be able to enjoy a peaceful life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh my. Did selling finballs bring you such enlightenment?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, food price inflation is a lot more dangerous to me than the mob.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Dai Lo, won't you be my neighbor here? The Feng Shui is excellent, and I hear you get a better deal buying the plots in pairs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you done?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm joking. It's a joke. Aiya. At least you have a daughter. I'm going to die alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have all the kids in the slums with you, don't you? And that Ah Fil boy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "But there's no blood. It makes a difference when you get old.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "text": "...So you have to outlive me, a bit. Not too much. Just a bit. I'll wait for you down there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you always looking for ways to needle me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, I'm meeting an old friend later tonight. Would you like to join us for a drink?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "No thanks. I'm worried Ah Fil is off getting himself into trouble. I'd better look into it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll look into it for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how many old friends do I have left? I think they're all down there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't talk with the one called Wei. I've been dealing with him a long time. It would be very short-lived.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you took a bullet for Wei Yenwu. It's why you can't walk straight anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think I don't know? Feh, I don't want to talk about this. It always makes me feel wretched.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "text": "...But at least Lungmen can walk straight. At least she's not wretched.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the same as you ever were. And I guess that's a good thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you've really seen enough of him, then you better be on your way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "And even if he did see you, he probably wouldn't know what to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You finally let me go, Lin, this poor old wounded man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uncle Tung"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Tung.",
        "tag": "name",
